\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa160\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6822422 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid6822422 
Implementation Plan: Fix & Align Indus Traders ERP with Corrected Spec
\par 
\par  Context
\par 
\par  The Indus Traders ERP system already has a substantial codebase (333 backend files, 90+ frontend components). A       
\par  corrected specification (Indus_Traders_ERP_Specification_v2.md) was created fixing 28 inconsistencies found in the    
\par  original analysis. This plan aligns the existing code with the corrected spec \emdash  fixing bugs, adding missing modules,  
\par  and ensuring consistency.
\par 
\par  Stack: Node.js + Express + MongoDB (Mongoose) backend, Angular 18 + Material frontend.
\par 
\par  ---
\par  Gap Analysis Summary
\par 
\par  Already Built & Working (need minor fixes only):
\par 
\par  - Sales Invoice, Purchase Invoice, Sales/Purchase Lists
\par  - Cash Book (Receipt, Payment, PDC)
\par  - Cash Adjustment (needs rename to "Cash Movement")
\par  - E-Order system (needs conversion workflow)
\par  - Scheme/Bonus Management
\par  - Salary Package (already target-based model - correct)
\par  - Quotation (needs Qty column fix)
\par  - Purchase Order
\par  - Warehouse, Stock Movement
\par  - Bilty (backend only \emdash  biltyRoutes.js exists, no frontend feature)
\par  - Capital & Investment
\par  - Item Registration, Account Registration
\par  - User Management, Auth/Login
\par  - Dashboard, Reports, POS
\par  - Master Data (Towns, Areas, Categories, etc.)
\par  - Recovery Summary (backend exists \emdash  recoverySummaryRoutes.js, no frontend)
\par  - SMS (backend exists \emdash  smsRoutes.js)
\par  - Tax Reports (backend exists, tax config routes COMMENTED OUT)
\par 
\par  Missing Completely (must build from scratch):
\par 
\par  1. Expenses Module \emdash  No model, controller, route, or frontend
\par  2. Letters & Agreements Module \emdash  Nothing exists
\par  3. Investor Profit Share \emdash  Capital model has profit_share type but no calculation module
\par  4. Route Plan & Sales Target (full module) \emdash  Route model exists, but no route plan creation with weekly schedule +    
\par  target assignment frontend
\par  5. Email Security Alerts \emdash  No email service for login alerts
\par 
\par  Needs Fixing:
\par 
\par  6. Tax Routes \emdash  Commented out in routes/index.js (line 120)
\par  7. Bilty \emdash  Backend exists, no frontend feature module
\par  8. Recovery Summary \emdash  Backend exists, no frontend feature module
\par  9. Quotation \emdash  Missing Qty column in items (already has quantity field in model \emdash  frontend needs to show it)
\par  10. E-Order \emdash  Has convertToInvoice in backend but frontend may lack the button/workflow
\par  11. Capital \emdash  Model uses investment/withdrawal/dividend/profit_share but spec says In/Out with asset name
\par  12. Sales Invoice \emdash  Verify Salesman + Dimension fields on create form
\par  13. Sales List \emdash  Verify Dimension column
\par 
\par  ---
\par  Implementation Phases
\par 
\par  Phase A: Database & Model Fixes (~15 files)
\par 
\par  A1. Capital Model \emdash  Align with spec
\par  - File: Backend/src/models/Capital.js
\par  - Change: Add assetName, direction (In/Out), investorType (Proprietor/Investor), cashAccountId fields
\par  - Keep existing fields for backward compat, add new ones
\par 
\par  A2. Create Expense Model
\par  - File: Backend/src/models/Expense.js (NEW)
\par  - Fields: date, categoryId (ref ExpenseCategory), accountId (ref Account), cashAccountId (ref Account), amount,       
\par  detail, dimensionId, userId, createdAt
\par 
\par  A3. Create ExpenseCategory Model
\par  - File: Backend/src/models/ExpenseCategory.js (NEW)
\par  - Fields: categoryName, status
